cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "safeharbor-check: check a structured CSV against the HIPAA Safe Harbor identifier classes"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/safeharbor-check"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/safeharbor-check"
abstract: >-
  Checks a structured CSV against the 18 HIPAA Safe Harbor identifier
  classes (A)-(R) in 45 CFR 164.514(b)(2), and can apply the rule's
  three mechanical fixes to declared columns (dates to year, ZIP
  codes to three digits, ages over 89 to 90+). A checker only: it is
  not a certifying tool, and a clean report does not mean a file
  meets HIPAA requirements. Research and educational tool only; not
  a medical device; not legal advice.
keywords:
  - HIPAA
  - Safe Harbor
  - de-identification
  - privacy
  - CSV checker
